# Design System

- Tokens: background `#0B0F1B`, surface `#151C2B`, border `#303C52`, ember `#FF6542`, electric `#27C9EC`, gold `#FFB84D`.
- Fonts: Oxanium headings/numbers, Sora UI/body.
- Use brand assets from `src/assets/brand`. Never import Pokémon symbols from mockups.
- Prefer subtle motion; honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Accessible focus states and image alts required.
